00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:13.250
And, as you can see,
if you run the query,

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:14.945
you get 10 as a
result back there.

00:08:14.945 --> 00:08:16.070
And you're saying, OK, wow.

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:17.653
Well, SQL and BigQuery
is nothing more

00:08:17.653 --> 00:08:19.650
than a really big calculator.

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:20.150
And, yeah.

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:20.899
Well, that's true.

00:08:20.899 --> 00:08:21.770
Extrapolate this.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:25.070
Say you didn't have 5 and
5, but you added an order,

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:27.150
