00:08:43.342 --> 00:08:44.550
And not only does it do that.

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:46.466
But it filters for each
of the different pages

00:08:46.466 --> 00:08:47.730
where the title--

00:08:47.730 --> 00:08:50.460
