00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:20.700
You can see here all of the
rows, all of the records.

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:25.550
And you can also see all of the
fields displayed on the screen.

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:27.810
Let's take a look at
the submission date

00:14:27.810 --> 00:14:32.730
on the left, which is
the dates and times when

00:14:32.730 --> 00:14:34.940
the transactions were made.

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:38.340
It looks like, if you look
