00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.830
So this is why I'm going
to change the type.

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:38.290
And now that we
changed the type,

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:40.410
you can see that
there is a red bar.

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:43.970
This means that some values
are mismatched or misformatted.

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:45.585
Let's take a closer look.

00:16:45.585 --> 00:16:46.460
I'm clicking on that.

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:50.850
And that highlights all of the
incorrect or mismatched values.

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:58.010
Incorrect here.

00:16:58.010 --> 00:17:01.860
There is also the dollar
amount right there.

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:04.920
So to be able to do some
calculation on those numbers,

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:06.740
we will need to remove
those characters.

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:08.198
And there, again,
this is something

00:17:08.198 --> 00:17:10.970
we can do here by selecting
a transformation here.

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:14.181
What I'm going to do is
