00:21:05.985 --> 00:21:07.360
So here what I'm
going to do, I'm

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:10.090
going to create a new
column with a flag.

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:13.850
And that flag is going to be
true for all of the values that

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:15.220
are misformatted.

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:17.290
And that way our
marketing team can just

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.550
