00:41:58.930 --> 00:42:00.630
So just to give you an idea.

00:42:00.630 --> 00:42:01.980
EVAN JONES: Great.

00:42:01.980 --> 00:42:03.102
When would you use--

00:42:03.102 --> 00:42:04.560
I think you answered
this in part--

00:42:04.560 --> 00:42:07.950
Dataprep versus using
something like DataFlow?

00:42:07.950 --> 00:42:10.860
JULIEN PHALIP: So
Dataprep I would

00:42:10.860 --> 00:42:12.960
use for exploration
